      "span_text": "### Objective The goal is to generate a list of alloys that have an annealing temperature between 300°C and 800°C and a modulus of elasticity between 10,000 ksi and 18,000 ksi. For each alloy, the name, annealing temperature, modulus of elasticity, and source must be provided. ### Execution Summary The task was accomplished through a two-step search process. 1. An initial broad search was performed to identify online material property databases. The query used was `alloy material properties database annealing temperature modulus of elasticity`. This search successfully identified MatWeb as a reliable source and yielded two alloys that met the specified criteria. 2. A second, more targeted search was conducted specifically on the MatWeb website to find additional alloys. The query used was `site:matweb.com alloy \"modulus of elasticity\" \"annealing temperature\"`. This search returned several more aluminum alloys that fit the property requirements. The information from both searches was then compiled to create the final list of alloys. ### Final Answer The following is a list of alloys that meet the specified criteria, along with their properties and sources: | Alloy Name | Annealing Temperature (°C) | Modulus of Elasticity (ksi) | Source | | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | | **Aluminum 2024-T851** | 413 | 10500 | `https://asm.matweb.com/search/SpecificMaterial.asp?bassnum=MA2024T851` | | **Aluminum 7050-T73511** | 413 | 10400 | `https://asm.matweb.com/search/SpecificMaterial.asp?bassnum=MA7050T735` | | **Aluminum 2017-O** | 338 - 349 | 10500 | `https://asm.matweb.com/search/SpecificMaterial.asp?bassnum=MA2017O` | | **Aluminum 7178-T76** | 413 | 10300 | `https://asm.matweb.com/search/SpecificMaterial.asp?bassnum=ma7178t76` | | **Aluminum 2219-O** | 413 | 10600 | `https://asm.matweb.com/search/SpecificMaterial.asp?bassnum=MA2219O` | | **Aluminium 2024-T351**| 413 | 10600 | `https://asm.matweb.com/search/specificmaterial.asp?bassnum=ma2024t4` | | **Aluminum 5252-O** | 343 | 10000 | `https://www.matweb.com/search/datasheet_print.aspx?matguid=fe9372f9e0b94f308381b46008152624` | | **Aluminum 2124-O** | 413 | 10600 | `https://asm.matweb.com/search/SpecificMaterial.asp?bassnum=MA2124O` | | **Aluminum 5083-H32** | 413 | 10200 | `https://asm.matweb.com/search/SpecificMaterial.asp?bassnum=MA5083H32` | | **Aluminum 6063-O** | 413 | 10000 | `https://asm.matweb.com/search/SpecificMaterial.asp?bassnum=MA6063O` | | **Aluminum 7075-T6** | 413 | 10400 | `https://asm.matweb.com/search/specificmaterial.asp?bassnum=ma7075t6` |"
